// The LED backlight of a 1602 character LCD module, from A (pin 15) to K (pin 16). Vishay
// LCD-016N002B p. 1 gives its forward voltage, 4.2 V typical at 25 C, and an edge-lit forward
// current of 20 mA typical and 40 mA maximum, and no curve. The fit keeps the curve shape of
// the Kingbright L-934QWC-D white LED and moves it to pass 4.2 V at 20 mA.
